Fri Nov 13 11:33:55 UTC 2026 - Jan Engelhardt <jengelh@inai.de>

- Update to release 1.2.0
  * Fix compatibility with the development version of GAP, where
    `Grobner`, `SGrobner` and everything built on them failed with
    the error "`<type>` implies `IsDataObjectRep` but `<obj>`
    requires `IsComponentObjectRep`".
  * Fix `InstallNoncommutativeMonomialOrdering` failing when given
    the name of the new ordering as a string, as the manual
    describes
  * Fix module elements being printed without their zero
    components, e.g. `[ b - 1 ]` instead of `[ b - 1 , 0]`, after
    an earlier computation used fewer module generators.

